# Piloto operacional curto: nao mede convergencia nem propriedades de equilibrio.
! MD Native-XTB2 ALPB(water)
%maxcore 256
%md
  Timestep 0.5_fs
  Randomize 42
  Initvel 300_K
  Thermostat CSVR 300_K Timecon 100_fs
  Cell Sphere 0, 0, 0, 5_A Spring 10.0
  Dump Position Stride 1 Filename "trajetoria.xyz"
  Run 100
end
* xyz 0 1
O 0.0 0.0 0.0
H 0.758602 0.0 0.504284
H -0.758602 0.0 0.504284
*
